# Triage Results — 7-Question Gate

**Program:** Naver Whale Browser (scope.yml: latest-version Whale browser, Whale-only libs, Synchronization)
**Scope exclusions:** All *.naver.com, *.navercorp.com, Papago/Belli servers, URL preview spoofing, XSS Auditor bypass, IETab, SafeBrowsing FP/FN
**Reporting channel:** TBD (operator-provided; not yet confirmed per scope.yml)

