| Q6 | **PASS** — Not on always-rejected list |
| Q7 | **NO** — "socket.io is unusual in browser core" is interesting, not a vulnerability |

**Verdict: INVALID** — Fails Q4: handler code not extracted/audited; runtime-fetched components may differ from static pak contents. No demonstration of unsanitized data reaching privileged APIs.

